@startuml
title API console - remove local saved login
actor Operator
participant "API console process" as CLI
participant ApiConsole as Command
participant ITokenStore as Store
Operator -> CLI : logout
CLI -> Command : LogoutAsync()
Command -> Store : Delete(configured API address)
Store --> Command : Removed / already absent
Command --> Operator : Local removal confirmation
opt environment override is set
  Command --> Operator : SMURFS_API_TOKEN remains active until unset
end
CLI --> Operator : Exit 0 (no server request)
@enduml
